# Production build (Vercel UI hostname is the public REST origin).
# Leave VITE_API_URL and VITE_WS_URL unset so the SPA can fail over:
#   REST → same-origin /api/* (Vercel rewrite → Ubuntu primary)
#       → https://api-backup-eth-amm-sim.magro.dev if Ubuntu /healthz fails
#   WS   → Ubuntu wss://api-staging-eth-amm-sim.magro.dev/stream
#       → MBP   wss://api-backup-eth-amm-sim.magro.dev/stream
# Pinning VITE_WS_URL here would disable that backup path.
